5. **Claim ownership** — claim authorship, ownership, or exclusive rights over
   the Software or any portion of it, or present it as your own work.
6. **Train AI / ML on it** — use, ingest, scrape, crawl, fetch or extract the
   Software (code, comments, structure, architecture, assets or documentation)
   for training, fine-tuning, validating or improving any machine-learning
   model, large language model, neural network, chatbot or AI pipeline.
