## 4. Enforcement (you will be pursued)

Any violation of any term automatically, immediately and permanently
terminates your license and any rights you may assert to the Software.

- The Licensor actively monitors public code hosts and search engines for
  copies of this Software; derivative works are matched against release
  fingerprints and traced back to their publisher.
- Each infringement entitles the Licensor to pursue **statutory damages of up
  to $150,000 per infringing work** plus attorneys' fees and costs (17 U.S.C.
  § 504), including the $2,500–$25,000 per-work range for unauthorised removal
  or alteration of Copyright Management Information (17 U.S.C. § 1203).
- Willful infringement may also constitute **criminal copyright**
  (18 U.S.C. § 2319), prosecutable as a felony.
- The Licensor will file **DMCA takedowns** against any infringing
  repository, fork, package or mirror (hosts routinely process these within
  24–48 hours) and may seek injunctive relief and both actual and exemplary
  damages against repeat infringers.
- All disputes arising under this License shall be adjudicated in the courts
  of the Licensor's jurisdiction, to the exclusion of any other forum, and
  You consent to that jurisdiction.

